
### Saved Jobs API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006
@candidateId = 1
@jobId = 1
@savedJobId = 1

### 1. Save a job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": {{jobId}}
}

### 2. Get my saved jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 3. Check whether a job is saved
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved/check?jobId={{jobId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 4. Try saving the same job again (expect duplicate error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": {{jobId}}
}

### 5. Remove a saved job
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved/{{savedJobId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 6. Check again (expect false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/preferences/saved/check?jobId={{jobId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
